            {
                "entry_id": "65419168-3231-3725-8e26-d5fac8a5507c",
                "word": "spillikins",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cca42091-8d84-3213-a692-06750ea57c3e",
                        "entry_id": "65419168-3231-3725-8e26-d5fac8a5507c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A game in which players attempt to remove flat, carved sticks of ivory or wood (the individual spillikins of meaning 1) from a scattered pile without disturbing any stick other than the one currently being removed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "770ab302-a39a-4e24-a36f-28f14fb51186",
                                "sense_id": "cca42091-8d84-3213-a692-06750ea57c3e",
                                "text": "Spillikins is a game of skill."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ec01883-ac99-49fb-8928-3ea0c33108a0",
                                "sense_id": "cca42091-8d84-3213-a692-06750ea57c3e",
                                "text": "Charlie loves playing spillikins."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb04336e-a454-4aeb-bda0-28153cb4c070",
                                "sense_id": "cca42091-8d84-3213-a692-06750ea57c3e",
                                "text": "Our little visitor has just left us [...].–Half her time here was spent at Spillikins; which I consider as a very valuable part of our Household furniture, & as not the least important Benefaction– from the family of Knight to that of Austen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c865bd0-b0d5-4c91-abf9-fd480b5661db",
                                "sense_id": "cca42091-8d84-3213-a692-06750ea57c3e",
                                "text": "But she was much too impatient to be good at spillikins, moving them too fast, not wheedling them out by delicate degrees. (page 109)\nAfter the news of Bunty’s father, Emily became increasingly quiet and withdrawn. [...] Her homework done, she sat playing endless solitary games – of patience or spillikins or draughts. (page 158)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e76de2b8-fd4e-46a0-bf94-8ec9d6c72857",
                                "sense_id": "cca42091-8d84-3213-a692-06750ea57c3e",
                                "text": "Spillikins is played the same way that early versions of Jack Straw and the American “pick up sticks” are."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "323e04f0-8049-419f-954f-a3f7b0e19ae7",
                        "source_entry_id": "65419168-3231-3725-8e26-d5fac8a5507c",
                        "source_sense_id": "cca42091-8d84-3213-a692-06750ea57c3e",
                        "source_sense_description": "a game of skill",
                        "target_lang_word": "jonchets",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "jonchets",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd00e537-afeb-3bb1-b6ee-a203501de1ba",
                                        "entry_id": "1bc7ce1d-9139-3e63-8b83-bbaa4d5b8f04",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pluriel de jonchet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cbbb260-b4af-46a9-a9f2-9c53b176d52a",
                                                "sense_id": "bd00e537-afeb-3bb1-b6ee-a203501de1ba",
                                                "text": "Des jonchets d’ivoire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af18d192-71ca-3572-a4f0-cb508013ba87",
                                        "entry_id": "1bc7ce1d-9139-3e63-8b83-bbaa4d5b8f04",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Jeu utilisant des jonchets, et consistant à retirer des bâtonnets entremêlés au moyen d’un crochet sans en heurter aucun autre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa2dea5e-1a01-4862-92ad-4376a26f8261",
                                                "sense_id": "af18d192-71ca-3572-a4f0-cb508013ba87",
                                                "text": "Jouer aux jonchets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67dca163-a87b-4ae2-9240-a5af3feab28f",
                                                "sense_id": "af18d192-71ca-3572-a4f0-cb508013ba87",
                                                "text": "Là, en effet, s’étaient entassés, énorme jeu de jonchets, les arbres abattus par l’orage ou tombés de vieillesse, comme si la hache du bûcheron leur eût donné le coup de mort."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eff43231-9e8f-4f8c-bc2e-02969157fe91",
                                                "sense_id": "af18d192-71ca-3572-a4f0-cb508013ba87",
                                                "text": "C’en était fait pour moi du Paris un peu provincial de l’Hôtel des Palais, des promenades au Cours la Reine et à l’avenue Gabriel, des quelques goûters chez Jeanne avec Clément et Axel, suivis d’un jeu de jonchets où nous retenions notre souffle pour ne pas faire bouger les fragiles tiges d’ivoire, ou de l’innocent Jeu de l’Oie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
